      "Ingredients": "Rice 1 cup*Channa dal 3/4 cup*Udad dal 1/8 cup*Thur dal 1/8 cup*( i.e. 1 cup mixed dal)*Red chilly 4 - 6*asafetida powder 1/4 sp*Salt*Oil to make adai",
