      "Title": "Aloo Cheese ka Paratha",
      "Ingredients": "1 cup wheat flour *1/2 cup boiled & mashed potatoes *1/4 cup grated cheese *1 chopped green chilli *1/2 tea spoon garam masala *1/2 tea spoon red chilli powder *1/2 tea spoon coriander powder *1/2 tea spoon ginger garlic paste *Salt to taste *1/2 cup oil",
      "Method": "*Take all the above ingredients add 2 table spoon oil and knead a dough. *Roll chapatti out of that dough and fry it with oil on a pan or on tawa. *Serve it with Green Chutney or with Tomato Ketchup.",
