      "Method": "*Cook and peal potatoes. Cut them like finger and keep aside.*Chop onion. Put a pan and make seasoning. *Add chopped onions and fry well *Now add cut potatoes and fry well. *Simmer the stove and let the potato pieces fry well *Add asafetida powder and meethi leaves. *You can serve this curry with chapatti /puri.*",
