      "Title": "Alu Bondas with gravy",
      "Ingredients": "Prepare Bondas as per the previous recipe.*For gravy:*250gms. Red Tomatoes*100 gms Onion*2 – 4 green chilies*2 garlic pods*2 tea spoon corn flour*Salt to taste*1 sp cumin seeds*Oil to make tempering*Fresh coriander leaves",
      "Method": "*Cut tomatoes, green chilies and garlic.*Put them in a mixer grinder and make paste/ thick gravy.*Don’t add water.*In a pan pour oil and fry cumin seeds.*Pour the grind mixture in that.*Bring it to a boil. Add salt.*Add water and corn flour in a bowl and pour this in the boiling mixture/ gravy to make the correct consistency. (Optional)*If you are satisfied with the tomato mixture itself means don’t add this corn flour.*Bring it to a boil. Stir continuously after adding the corn flour to avoid lumps.*Remove from the fire.*Serving:* *Pour this gravy in a serving bowl add 2 bondas and garnish with fresh coriander leaves and serve hot.*Very tasty snack for evening.",
