      "Method": "*Pour oil in a pan and make seasoning with mustard seeds, cumin seeds, chopped ginger and garlic.*Put chopped onions and fry well.*Add diced potatoes (cooked) and cooked Channa.*Now add chopped coriander leaves and curry leaves.*Serve with chappati/puri",
