      "Title": "Apple Thiratu pal",
      "Ingredients": "Low fat milk 3 cups*Grated apple 1 cup*Cardamom powder 1/2 sp*Saffrom 10 - 12 string*Sweetner 2 - 3 packets*",
      "Method": "*Pour milk in a deep container and make gova out of that.*It will take at least 15 min.*When it is thick, add apple and mix well. *Sim the flame and allow apple to cook.*Add cardamom powder and mix well.*Now add sweetner and remove from the fire.*Serve hot or cold.*",
