      "Ingredients": "4 Baby corn *1 onion *1 tomato (optional) *1 tbsp. cream (non dieting people) *1 tea sp. butter *1 Bay leaf *Salt & Black pepper as per taste *Corn flour - milk mixture 2 tbsp.",
      "Method": "*Pressure cook baby corns. *Put butter in a pan and fry chopped onions. *Put cut bay leaf and cooked baby corn with 3 - 4 cups of water. *Bring it to a boil and add corn flour - milk mixture and mix well. *Add salt and let it boil for 5 - 6 minutes.",
