      "Method": "*Place the milk in a heavy-bottomed pan over a high heat. *Bring it to boil, stirring constantly, then reduce the heat and simmer for 2 minutes. *While the milk is simmering, place a banana, sugar and nutmeg in a blender and process until pureed. *pour 1 cup milk into the blender and process for another minute. *Add the remaining milk and process for 1/2 minute.*Pour the milk in warmed mugs or cups and serve immediately to avoide the colour change.",
