      "Method": "Grate beet root. Grind that with salt, tamarind and red chilly in a mixer grinder.*Make seasoning with mustard seeds and udad dal*Add chopped onions to that and fry well*Add the grind beet root in that and fry again*Add salt and stir well*Remove from the fire and serve with dosa or eat with rice.",
