      "Method": "In a pan pour ghee and fry kis mis and cashew nuts.*Keep them aside. And fry besan flour well.*Fry well with out blacking it.*Add water and allow it to cook.*Add sufficient water so that besan will cook well.*Add sugar and mix well. Add milk.*Allow it to boil.*Add cardamom powder, fried cashew nuts and kis mis.*Remove from the fire.*Add badam essence and kesar colour.*Serve hot or cold.*Almost it will be like badam kheer.",
