      "Ingredients": "2 cups of boiled chopped potatoes*1 1/2 cup chopped onions*1/2 cup chopped coriander leaves*1 1/2 cup grated carrots*2-3 tsp red chilli powder/ fienely chopped green chilies*2 cups sev*6 cups of rice crispies (Pori)*10-15 rice vadas*3/4 cup sweet chutney*3/4 cup hot chutney*1/4 cup mint chutney*2-3 tsp chat masala*Salt to taste*2 tablespoon of oil(optional)*Juice of one big lime*For Mint Chutney:*1/2 cup mint leaves*Juice of one big lime*Salt to taste*1 tsp chopped ginger*1 1/2 tsp chopped garlic*2 tbsp chopped onions",
