      "Method": "Remove corners from bread slices.*Just dip them in water and squeeze them and put them in a basin.  *Put all the other ingredients in that and mix well.*And make it as a thick dough.*Now take a lemon size ball of dough and shape it as per your wish.*Keep a shallow pan on the stove and keep the cutlet on it.*Now pour oil and cook it well.*Turn it and again pour some oil and shallow fry it. *yummy bread cutlet is ready to serve.*Serve it with tomato ketchup.",
