      "Ingredients": "We can prepare a very delicious sweet by using bread with in 15minutes.*Take the following items to prepare bread jamoons. Surely you can make happy your family by preparing this with excess bread.**10 slices of bread (sweet bread)*1 cup of sugar*Oil to fry*Rose essence some drops.",
