      "Ingredients": "Left over Bread slices - 5 - 6*1/2 cup all purpose flour *3-4 tsp Corn flour *2 tsp Ginger finely chopped *1 tsp Garlic finely chopped *Spring onions - 1 bunch finely chopped *Soya sauce - 2 spoons *Ajinomotto - a pinch *Chilly powder *Salt *Oil for frying *Water",
