      "Method": "*First put all the slices in the mixer grinder and make a soft powder and keep aside.*Soak both the dal in water for 45 minutes*Add chilies, salt, asafetida with soaked dal and grind them all with out adding much water*Bake the mixture in steam for about 10 minutes*Pour oil in a pan and put the steamed dal mixture after seasoning*Mix well. After 2 -3 minutes put the bread powder in the pan and mix well*If you want add lemon juice*Remove from the fire and serve with chutney.",
