      "Method": "*For Filling **Heat one spoon of oil in a pan. *Add mustard seeds and allow it to crackle... then add curry leaves and finely chopped green chilies. *Add in his turmeric powder and stir.*Now add boiled and mashed Potatoes and salt. *Mix well and stir for 2-3 mins.*Keep this curry in a plate and allow it to cool.*Now mix gram flour with water, salt, red chilli powder and soda make a fine batter.*Take the bread slices. *Fill one slice of bread with potato filling and cover with other slice of the bread and cut this in to four equal squares.*Dip this properly in the gram flour batter and deep fry in oil till it is done.*Serve hot with Green Chutney or Tomato Sauce. You can also enjoy this with hot tea.",
