      "Method": "Soak bread in buttermilk and grind it in a mixer grinder.*Add salt and black pepper in it.*To make utthappam, pour the dough in a shallow pan and make a thick dosa.*Pour oil around it. *Mix onion, tomato, green chilly and coriander leaves in a bowl.*Now put one spoon full of the mixer on the utthappam and turn the uththappam.*Again pour some oil around it.*Let it cook for a min.*Then remove the Bread Uththappam from the stove and serve it with tomato sauce.",
