      "Title": "Brinjal (Eggplant) Curd Pachadi",
      "Ingredients": "**one big Brinjal*1 cup curd*2 red chilly*1/4 sp asafetida powder*1/2 sp Mustard*Curry leaves*1 sp chopped coriander leaves*Salt*1 sp Oil",
