      "Title": "Chat Pori",
      "Ingredients": "3 cups puffed rice*1 onion finely chopped*1 tomato finely chopped*1/2 cucumber, peeled and finely chopped*1/4 cup pomegranate seeds*1 tbsp. coriander finely chopped*1 tbsp. tamarind chutney*1 tsp. green chutney*1/2 tsp. crushed cumin*1/4 cup crushed cornflakes*salt to taste",
