      "Title": "Coconut Khova Ice cream",
      "Ingredients": "1-1/2 lt whole milk*50 gms. soft khova*1 cup fresh cream*1 cup dry coconut powder*1 cup sugar*1/2 tsp. vanilla essence*1 tbsp. corn flour dissolved in 2 tbsp. cold milk*1/2 tsp. cardamom powder*10-12 strands saffron*1 tsp. instant coffee powder",
