      "Method": "*Clean coriander seeds and grease a pan and fry well.*Make Tamarind into small pieces and fry it till it becomes dry and crisp*Fry all the other ingredients except Tamarind*Put everything in dry Mixer Grinder and grind coarse*You can mix with hot or cold cooked rice and eat by adding Ghee",
