      "CategoryId": 29,
      "Title": "Coriander Thuvial",
      "Ingredients": "1 Cup Coriander leaves chopped*1/2 spoon Mustard Seeds*2 spoon Udad Dhal*2 spoon Channa dal*10-15 Red Chilies*1 Pinch asafetida*1 spoon Oil*1/2 the small lemon size Tamarind*Salt to taste*Black Pepper",
      "Method": "*Soak Tamarind in water. *Fry all the other ingredients except coriander leaves. *Put fresh chopped coriander leaves, and all other fried ingredients in a mixer grinder and grind with water. *Grind them by using less / no water water so that you can keep the Thuvaiyal for many days with out refrigeration. *Normal persons, can mix with hot or cold cooked rice and eat by adding Ghee.*",
