      "Method": "*Boil the milk*Keep aside half of the milk and cool the other half*In the cool half put the amulya milk powder and mix it well in the milk.*Now heat the mixture of above milk and other half along with the dry fruit, sugar, grated*Paneer and cardamom, stir it well till the mixture becomes thick (say for 5-10 minutes).*You can add green colour and rose essence.",
