      "Method": "*Wash and drain cabbage.*Heat oil in a non-stick pan.*Add cummin, mustard and urad dal.*Let it splutter.*Add asafetida, green chilies, curry leaves, turmeric powder.*Add cabbage, capsicum and salt.*Toss lightly with spoon.*Sprinkle garam masala and amchoor powder.*Toss it again.*Cook for 3-4 minutes stirring continuously till it is crisp.*Garnish with coriander leaves. Serve with phulkas.",
