      "Ingredients": "You can put left over chapatti one by one in the Micro Wave Oven and make them crispy.*OR",
      "Method": "Just put the done chapatti in the oven and set the time for 1 minute. Now turn the other side and again put 30seconds, if the chapatti is crispy it is ok*Otherwise put another 30 seconds and make it crispy. Now you can have the crispy chapatti with tea.*Other wise you can store in a air tight container for more than a week.",
