      "Method": "*Add all ingredients to the potatoes except oil and bread.*Run the bread in a dry mixie to get fine bread crumbs. *Keep aside.*Mash the potato well. *If required add more salt or green chillies.*If too soggy add 1-2 tsp cornflour. *Mix bread crumbs with cornflour. *Shape the mixture into patties of desired shape. *Roll in the crumbs. *Heat tawa add some oil to shallow fry, place a few patties .*When browned turn over to fry other side.*Serve hot with chilled coke, tea or milkshake. *Serve with tomato sauce.",
