      "Ingredients": "3 cup drumstick flowers*2 medium onions*1/2 tsp red chilli powder*2 tbsp besan*1/2 tsp coriander seed roasted and powdered*1 cup coconut *1/4 tsp turmeric powder*2 tbsp rice flour*salt to taste *1/2 tsp tamarind paste*oil for frying",
