      "Method": "*Mix all ingredients except almond slices.*Put to heat, bring to a boil. *Stir well.*Reduce, simmer for 2 minutes. *Pour into cup, from a height. *This way a lot of froth will form on the milk. *Sprinkle the almond slices on top. *Serve piping hot. *",
