      "Method": "*Mix together condensed milk and milk.*Boil on low-medium flame.*Dissolve custard powder in small qty of milk and pour it into the milk when it reaches boil.*Simmer gas for 5 mins till mixture is thick.*Then, take off and cool for a while.*Now divide the qty of the mixture into two, by pouring it into 2 separate vessels.*Add vanilla essence with yellow color into the mixture in one vessel and pista essence with green color into mixture in another vessel.*Keep the 2 vessels in fridge. After an hour, remove the 2 vessels, beat the contents separately in mixie and keep the 2 vessels again in fridge like before.*Before serving:**Take oval shape bowl; Put 2 scoops of ice cream; one vanilla and one pista.*Put cut fruits on that.*(If you want you can make sugar syrup/chocolate sauce; and pour on that.)*Put cut dry fruits on them.*Press one wafer biscut and serve.*Children will like this very much.",
