      "Ingredients": "Cauliflower 100gms (Gobi)*Maida 100gms*Cornflour 25gms*Agi no moto 1 Tea spoon*White pepper 1 Tea spoon*Salt to taste*oil to fry*For Masala:*Onion 1 cup*Garlic 1 cup*Ginger 1 piece*Green chilly 1*Spring onion 1*Tomato sauce 1 Tea spoon*Green chilly sause 1 Tea spoon*Oil 4 Tea spoon",
