      "Id": 221,
      "CategoryId": 21,
      "Title": "Introduction",
      "Ingredients": "*We can prepare dosa dough by soaking dal and rice or we can prepare them by adding rava, Maida or rice flour. *Here let us see some types of dosa dough and with that you can prepare dosa.*In this section, let us see some other tiffen items like Dosa also.*They are not Dosa, but we have to prepare these items in the same tava like Dosa. (Adai)*Some items we have to prepare in a &quot;shallow&quot; pan. (Aapam)*Let us see the items.",
      "Method": "*Generally we prepare Dosa by pouring oil. Other than that we can use pure ghee, butter or oil and ghee mix to prepare delicious Dosa.**If we prepare thin Dosa by pouring ghee means it becomes Ghee Roast.**While preparing Masala Dosa if we use butter in the middle of the Dosa, it becomes Butter Masala **Like this according to your taste or by using your ideas, you can make many varieties of Dosas.",
      "Notes": "",
