      "Method": "*Whip the cream till it forms a peak.*Gently mix it with the condensed and evaporated milks.*Add rest of the ingredients and mix well.*Pour into Kulfi molds and freeze for at least 6 hours or till frozen well.*De-mold and serve with your favorite topping.",
