      "Method": "*Dry fry all the above ingredients seperatly.*Put every thing in mixer grinder and grind soft powder.*Serve with hot rice and ghee.*This will digest easily for ladies who are giving milk to babies and the baby will not vomit the milk.*This will avoid ‘gas formation’ in stomach.",
