      "Title": "Karnataka Rasam",
      "Ingredients": "1 cup Cooked thur dal*4 tomato*2 sp tamarind paste*1/2 sp cumin seeds*1/2 sp mustard seeds*1/2 sp red chilly powder*1 coriander seeds*1/2 sp turmeric powder*1/4 sp asafetida *2 tab sp coconut (fresh)*2 sp ghee*salt*curry leaves *coriander leaves",
      "Method": "*In a pan pour cooked dal, tomato, chilly powder, turmeric powder, salt,asafetida and tamarind paste.*Allow it to boil for a while.*Grind coconut and coriander seeds.*Add it to the rasam.*Let it boil for a while.*Add 1/2 cup of water and again bring it to a boil.*In a pan pour ghee and make seasoning and pour it on the rasam.*Add curry leaves and your sarru is ready.*Garnish with coriander leaves.",
      "Notes": "",
