      "Method": "Wash and soak rice.*Heat butter/gheel and fry onions till golden brown and remove.*Fry cashew nuts and remove.*Fry whole spices, then add drained rice and mix well.*Add half-saffron dissolved in little warm milk.*Add hot water and mix well.*Cook a little.*Put the remaining saffron and tutty fruit and kismiss.*Cook till grains are separated and done.*Garnish kashmiri pulao with fried onions, walnuts & cashew nuts.*Your colorful Kashmiri Pulao is ready to serve.",
