      "CategoryId": 37,
      "Title": "Keerai (Greens) Rice",
      "Ingredients": "cooked Rice – 1 cup*Any available keerai chopped – 2 cups ( mulai keerai, sirukeerai or araikeerai)*Sambar Onion – 5 Nos*Tomato – 1 No (option)*Garlic flakes – 4 Nos*Green Chillies – 2 Nos*Sambar Powder - 2 teaspoons*Turmeric powder – a pinch*Ghee – 4 tablespoon*Mustard – ½ teaspoon*Urad dhal – 1 teaspoon*Salt – 1 teaspoon or as per taste",
      "Method": "Chop the onion. Slit the green chillies into two.*Chop the tomatoes finely. Crush the garlic.*In a kadai put the ghee and make seasoning.*Add chopped onion, green chillies, garlic and fry well.*Then add tomato pieces and fry till it mashes well.*Add sambar powder, turmeric powder and salt and mix well.*Add chopped greens and stir well.*Reduce the heat and close with lid.*Allow to cook for just two minutes.*No need to add water.*Open the lid and stir well and add the cooked rice.*Mix gently.Remove from the fire.*Serve with potato chips.",
