      "Title": "Keerai Vadai",
      "Ingredients": "Keerai 1 bunch ( seeru keerai, mulai keerai or arai keerai or murungai keerai)*Udad dal 1 cup*Channa dal 1/2 cup*Red chilly 5 - 6 or Green chilly 5 - 6*Onion 1 big*Ginger 1 piece*Cumin seeds*Salt*oil to fry vada",
      "Method": "Soak dals for 1 hour.*Grind them with ginger, cumin seeds and chilly.*Chop onion and washed and chopped keerai.*Mix with ground dal and add salt.*Mix well and make vada.*Serve \"Keerai Vadai\" with any chutney.",
