      "Ingredients": "For Koftas*1 1/2 cups leftover rice*1/2 cup grated bottlegourd*salt to taste*1 tbsp chopped corriander*1 tsp rice flour*1/2 tsp chilli powder / 2 green chilly*oil to to deep fry*For Gravy*2 red chilli*8-10 cashewnuts*1 tomato*1 onion*2-3 garlic*1\" piece ginger*1/4 tsp cinnamon powder*1 tsp red chilli powder*1/4 tsp turmeric powder*1/2 tsp garam masala*2 sp butter*salt*oil to fry",
      "Method": "*Mix all ingredients for gravy and grind in a grinder. *Keep aside. *Squeeze water from the grated gourd. *Add all other ingredients for Koftas, except oil.*Make table tennis-ball sized rounds. *Fry till golden.*Used 2 tbsp butter in another kadai and heat. *Add gravy and fry for 4-5 minutes till the oil separates. *Add Koftas and bring to boil. *Serve hot with chapatis or puris.*Mm.. heavenly taste.",
