      "Ingredients": "Raw rice- 1 cup *Boiled  rice- 1 cup *Urad dhal - 1/8 cup *Baking soda- a pinch *Salt to taste *For seasoning:*Mustard -1 tsp *Asafoetida- a pinch *Jeera- 1 tsp *Curry Leaves-5 to 6 *Ginger- 1/4 tsp ( grated) *Coconut grated or finely cut- 1 cup *Onion- 1cup (finely chopped) *Green Chilly- 5 (finely chopped) *Coriander leaves- 1/4 cup (chopped)",
      "Method": "*Soak the raw rice , idle rice and urad dhal for 3 to 4 hrs and grind it in to a dosa atta consistency. *And leave batter covered in the room temperature for about 8 to 10 hrs to ferment . *After 8 to 10 hrs the batter is ready to make kuzhi paniyaram , add the baking soda and mix well. *On the other side heat a pan with little oil season it with mustard, jeera ,curry leaves, asaofoetida ,green chilly and ginger.*Add this to the batter.*Add Coriander leaves and grated coconut. *And mix well . *Heat kuzhi paniyaram kal with oil and slowly pour the batter into the each portion . *After 2 minutes slowly try to turn the kuzhi paniyaram when golden brown. *Remove the kuzhi paniyaram when both sides are brown and well cooked inside in medium flame . *Serve kuzhi paniyram hot with tomato chutney, coconut chutney etc. *Serve kuzhi paniyaram as morning breakfast or evening tiffin .",
