      "Ingredients": "200 gms Potatos*1 Cup Yogurt*4-5 Green chilies*1 Cup deep fried Onions*1 Cup chopped Tomatoes*1 Spoon garam masala powder*1 Table Spoon Ginger, Garlic Paste*1 Table Spoon Coriander seeds*1 Tea Spoon Cumin seeds*1 Tea Spoon Red chilly powder*1/2 Spoon Crushed Black Pepper*1/2 Spoon Turmeric powder*Coriander leaves*Mint leaves*Salt*Oil to fry onion*2 Spoon Ghee",
