      "Ingredients": "1 cup dosa dough*2-3 boiled potatoes*1 onion chop finely*2 -3 green chilies cut finely*1 sp grated ginger*2 sp chopped coriander leaves*1 sp finely chopped garlic*1/2 sp mustared seeds*1/2 sp udad dal*1/2 sp channa dal*1/4 turmeric powder*Salt*Oil",
