      "Ingredients": "2 tea cups dried greenpeas*4 -5 finiely chopped green chilies*1 piece ginger (finely chopped)*1 table sp dhniya - jeera powder*1 table sp garam masala*1 table sp red chilly powder*1 table sp amchur*1/4 sp asafoetida*Salt to taste*For Serving:*2 tea cups Fresh Curds*1/2 table sp chilly powder*2 tea sp roasted cumin seed powder*2 table sp Sweet chutney (optional)*2 tea cups cooked with salt and diced potatoes (optional)",
