      "CategoryId": 14,
      "Title": "Masala Pal (Milk)",
      "Ingredients": "1 1/2 cups sugar*2 cup milk*1 tbsp. almonds*1 tbs cashew nuts*1 tbsp. kharbooj/tarbooj seeds skinned (commercially available)*(These are skinned dried seeds of watermelon and cantaloupes)*1/2 tbsp. khus khus (poppy seeds)*1 – clove *2 -3 cardamom whole pods*5 -6 pepper corns whole.*10 strings saffron*1 tbs Crushed pista & almond for garnish",
      "Method": "*Grind almond, cashew nuts, karbooj/tarbooj seeds, khus khus, clove, black pepper and cardamom ingredients to a very fine paste. (Not sugar) *Heat milk and mix the grind paste. *Mix well and allow it to boil.*Add sugar. Stir continuously.*Add saffron and remove from the fire.*Add crushed pista/almond.*Serve hot ‘Masala Pal/milk’.",
