      "Method": "Soak Moong Dal for 1 hr and grind to a Coarse mixture.*To this add finely chopped onions, finely cut green chilies and the finely cut coriander leaves.*Add turmeric,salt,hing,eno fruit salt and mix well.*Make pakodas in hear oil and deep fry in oil.*When the pakodas turn golden take it out and drain the oil on a kitchen napkin.*The Pakoras are ready to be served.*This can be had with Coconut chutney or Tomato Sauce.",
