      "Ingredients": "1 cup moong daal 4-5 tsp ghee*1 cup tuvar daal salt to taste*2 small zucchini; cut to small cubes*To Garnish:*2 onion; finely sliced*6-7 garlic; finely sliced*1 inch long ginger; finely sliced*a few bunches coriander leaves*3-4 tomatoes; cut into big cubes*1/2 tsp chat masala or a few drops of lemon juice*a few curry leaves*5 green chilies; sliced*1 tsp mustard seeds*1 tsp cumin seeds",
