      "Method": "Mix all ingredients in a bowl with enough water to make batter.*Pour the batter in a big spoonful on a warmed dosa tawa or non-stick tawa*Make small small dosa out of the dough.*Cool and pack.*If desired with green chutney or sauce.*",
