      "Method": "1. Soak Thur Dhal and Channa Dhal for a while.*   2. Grind all other ingredients except mustard seeds.*   3. In a pan, make seasoning with mustard seeds. Add buttermilk, masala and salt.*   4. Add salt and mix well and let it boil for five minutes*   5. Remove from the fire. Serve with rice.",
