      "Method": "Wash and clean keerai.*Chop well and keep aside.*Cut tomato and onion.*In a pan make seasoning.*Add onion and tomato. Fry well.*Add salt and mix well.*Allow it to cook.*Now add chopped keerai in that.*Add 1/2 cup water and mash the keerai.*Just close the lid.*Stir now and then.*Remove from the fire and serve with lunch as side dish.*Or you can mix rice with this.",
