      "Method": "In a deep pan pour oil and make seasoning.*Add washed Murungai keerai and fry it.*Now add moong dal and pour some water.*Close the lid and allow it to cook in low flame.*Stir now and then.*When dal half cooked and all the water evaporated, add coconut, salt and asafetida, mix well.*Remove from the fire and serve as side dish.*",
