      "Title": "Narthangai Kulambu",
      "Ingredients": "1 Narthangai (remove juice from that)*1 cup cooked thur dal*2 - 4 green chilies*Mustard seeds for seasoning*Curry leaves*1/4 sp. Fried and powdered fenugreek*Asafetida*Salt*Oil*2 sp Sambar powder*Turmeric powder",
