      "Method": "Chop pineapple into fairly small pieces, and halve segments.*Dissolve sugar, essence in orange juice, chill well.*Just before serving:*Blend juice and 1 scoop ice cream in mixie.*Pour into 3 ice cream cups.*Add segments and bits, mix well.*Float 1 ice cream scoop on each fruit cup.*Sprinkle crumbled chocolate*Serve immediately.",
