      "Method": "*Clean and Chop washed palak. *Heat ghee and fry chopped ginger and crushed garlic. *Add spinach and cook for 5 mins. *Add salt, turmeric and chilli powder. *Then add chopped tomatoes and cook.*Add Paneer cubes.*Add crushed elaichi, finely chopped green chillies and amchoor powder. *Cook for 3-4 mins. *Remove from the fire and Serve with chappati or bread.",
