      "Ingredients": "500 gms Panner*100 gms Butter*Oil to fry Panner pieces*For Masala:*2 -3 Onion*5 -6 Tomato*1” Ginger piece*10 -12 Garlic*2 sp Kas Kas*1/2 cup coconut*3 Cardamoms*1 Cinnamon stick*2 -3 Cloves*1 sp Red chilly powder*2 sp Coriander powder*½ coriander leaves",
      "Method": "*Fry panner in oil and keep aside.*Prepare masala.*In another pan pour butter and fry masala. Fry it for a while.*Add 2 cups of water and bring it to a boil.*Add salt and stir.*Add fried panner.*Remove from the fire and serve with chappati / puri.*",
