      "Ingredients": "Raw rice 250 gms*Boiled rice 100 gms*Udad dal 100 gms*Fenugreek 10 gms*grated panner 100 grams *2-3 boiled potatoes*1 onion chop finely*2 -3 green chilies cut finely*1 sp grated ginger*1/2 sp mustared seeds*1/2 sp udad dal*1/2 sp channa dal*1/4 turmeric powder*2 sp chopped coriander leaves*1 sp finely chopped garlic*Salt to taste*Ghee + Oil to make dosa",
