    {
      "Id": 1228,
      "CategoryId": 29,
      "Title": "Parappu thuvial",
      "Ingredients": "Thur dal 1 cup*Salt*Oil",
      "Method": "Just put 1/2 sp oil in a pan and fry thur dal well.*In a mixer grinder grind it with salt and water.*Remove from the grinder and serve with hot rice.*We usually prepare this thuvial as a good side dish for Poondu rasam.*You can have this with vethal kuzhumbu or vendhya kuzhumbu also.*That is with garlic rasam.*Children will like this thuvial very much because of its soft taste.",
