      "Ingredients": "500g green peas*4 tbsp gram flour*4 green chilies, chopped*2 tbsp chopped coriander leaves*1/3 tsp red chili powder*1/3 tsp black pepper powder*a pinch of sodium bicarbonate (cooking soda)*oil for frying",
