      "Method": "*Clean, wash and soak chana dal for one hour.*Pressure cook the dal with 3 cups of water. *Keep aside.*Heat ghee in a pan, add cloves, cinnamon stick, bayleafs, cumin seeds and fry until they pop up.*Add onions and fry till brown. Add salt and turmeric powder. Mix well.*Add dal and let it boil for few minutes.*Garnish with corainder leaves. When the dal will be cool, add lemon juice and stir well.*Serve sukhi chana daal hot with rice or paratha.",
