    {
      "Id": 183,
      "CategoryId": 32,
      "Title": "Rava Kitchadi",
      "Ingredients": "Fried rava 1 cup *Mustard seeds 1spoon*Udath dal 1 spoon *Channa dal 1 spoon*Turmeric powder 1 spoon *Curry patha a few leaves *Onion 2 medium size*Green chilies 4 - 5 *Garlic 4 - 5 flakes*Ginger 2 inch piece *Tomato 1 (optional)*Vegetable shortening or oil 1 – 2 table spoons*Salt to taste.*Carrot 2 -3 *French beans 10 - 12*Potato 1 big *Brinjal (egg plant) 1small*Peas a hand full *Green Pepper 1 big*Tamarind a small lemon size",
      "Method": "*First make seasoning with mustard seeds, Udad dal , Channa dal ,add green chilies, garlic, ginger, turmeric powder and cashew nuts. *Add onions add rava, salt and fry them.*Cook all other vegetables in Tamarind water in another pan with little salt.*Add cooked veg. in raw onion fried mixture and mix well*Cook rava well and remove it from the fire. *For this the best side is coriender chutney. *You can taste the RAVA KITCADI now. *Serve with coconut chutney or curd and pickle.",
      "Notes": "*Instead of tamarind water you can add tamarind paste.",
