      "Method": "Dry fry rava and make it powder in the mixer grinder and powder sugar separately.*Keep powdered rava and powdered sugar in separate bottles and whenever you need ladoos, just fry cashew nuts in ghee and mix them with rava powder and sugar powder.*Add ealachi powder also.*Delicious rava ladoos are ready.**More easier Method is this. *Fry rava and add sugar.*Add cardamom and make powder by giving it to a flour mill.*Store it in a air tight container.*Whenever you need ladoos, just fry cashew nuts in ghee and mix them with the Ready Made Rava Ladoo Mix.*Make ladoos out of that mixture.",
      "Notes": "Generally I will keep this Rava Ladoo Mix in my fridge to make ladoos for my one and only son, Krishna. He loves it very much. He will make ladoos of his own in my absence.",
