      "Method": "*Grate the red beet and finely chop the coriander. **Add all the above listed ingredients and make a dough out of it. *Take a small portion of the dough and roll them into parathas. *Roast them onto the tava by adding little ghee to it . *Delicious & colour ful Parathas are ready and tastes very good with spicy tomato chutney.",
