      "Method": "*Soak rice noodles in hot water. Or you can prepare as per rice sevai.*Blend garlic, ginger, red chilies, cumin seeds, coriander seeds, channa dal with water and make the masala paste*Heat oil in a pan and add masala paste, coconut milk, salt and sugar.*Bring it to a boil. When the gravy becomes thick remove it from the fire.*Drain the water from the noodles and spread them in a plate.*Pour the gravy one that and garnish with chopped spring onions.*Serve hot.",
