      "Method": "Cook rice noodles and keep aside.*In a deep pan, make seasoning and add green chilly and ginger.*Add cooked veg. and mix well.*Now add cooked noodles and mix well.*Remove from fire and serve.*It will look colourful and surely your children will love this dish.",
