      "Title": "Rice Rava Payasam",
      "Ingredients": "Rice rava 1 cup*Sugar 1 ½ cup*Milk ½ cup*Cardamom powder ½ sp*Ghee 2 – 3 sp*Cashew nuts 1 sp crushed*Kis Mis 1 sp, washed and cleaned",
      "Method": "In a pan pour ghee and fry kis mis and cashew nuts.*Keep them aside.*Add water and bring it to a boil.*Add rice rava in it and mix well.*Add sufficient water so that rice rava will cook well.*Add sugar and mix well. Add milk.*Allow it to boil.*Add cardamom powder, fried cashew nuts and kis mis.*Remove from the fire.*Serve hot or cold.",
