      "Title": "Rice sevai - Many varities",
      "Ingredients": "Make basic sevai.",
      "Method": "*You can prepare many varieties with the cooked rice sevai. *Make seasoning with mustard seeds, channa dal, udad dal, asafetida and green chilies. *If you want to prepare lemon sevai means add lemon juice with the sevai after making seasoning. *If you want to make curd sevai means add curd with the sevai. *If you want to prepare puli sevai means add pulikaichal i.e. puliyodra concentrate. *If you want to prepare coconut sevai means dry fry the grated coconut and add with sevai. *Other wise just add coconut oil and eat.",
