      "Title": "Rose Patels Rasam (Panner Rasam)",
      "Ingredients": "You can prepare this rasam with fresh rose pattels. You have to use less tamarind for this rasam.*½ cup cooked Thur dal*1 sp Tamarind Paste*1 – 1 ½ sp Rasam Powder*For Seasoning: *1 sp Mustard seeds*1 sp Cumin seeds*¼ sp Turmeric powder*A pinch of asafetida *Salt*½ sp Ghee*Coriander leaves*Fresh rose pattels",
