      "Ingredients": "Until now, we discussed about raw bread filling. Now let us fill the bread with cooked food and toast them.*For toasting, you can use electrical toasters or after filling toast them in tava.",
      "Method": "1. Potato Filling*   2. Tomato Thokku*   3. All Thuvaiyal Varieties )*   4. Concentrate of Tomato bath*   5. Pulikachal*   6. Green Chilies + Cheese*   7. Green Chilly Thokku*   8. You can keep any left over Curry inside as a filling.",
