      "Title": "Small onion Subji",
      "Ingredients": "1/2 cups small onion, peeled*1 large onion, peeled and diced into large pieces*4 carrots, diced into large pieces*3 large tomatoes, quartered*4 green chillies*1-inch cube of ginger, peeled*4 cardamoms*4 cloves*1-inch long piece of cinnamon*2 teaspoons chilli powder*2 teaspoons garam masala*4 tablespoons refined oil*Salt, according to taste*Finely chopped coriander leaves, for garnishing",
