      "Method": "*In a mixie bowl, put chopped raw mango, chat masala, coriander paste, chilly paste (you can put chopped chilies also) mint paste, cumin seeds, salt and garam masala.*Switch on the mixie and make a thick paste. *Sieve the flour. *Add curd, ginger-garlic and onion paste and oil. *Mix them, add mango – masala mixture and knead well to make a dough.*Cover for 1/2 hour with a damp cloth.*Divide the dough into equal parts. Make balls. *Flatten and fry poories in hot oil. *Serve these chatpati poories with plain curd.",
