      "Ingredients": "Spinach (chopped) 3 cups *Cucumber (chopped) 1 cup *Water 3-1/2 cups *Butter 1 tbsp. ( can put 1/2 sp.)*Black pepper powder 1/2 tsp. *Cumin powder 1/2 tsp. *Ginger paste 1/2 tsp. *Lemon juice 2 tbsp. *Salt to taste *Green chilly (optional)",
