      "Method": "*Give 4 cuts to lemons, keeping the whole lemon intact *Grate the ginger *In a steel vessel, put all the ingredients *Mix it well and fill the lemons.*Tie the vessel with muslin cloth *Keep it sun for 30 days *Store in air-tight container.",
