      "Ingredients": "Black udad dal 1 cup*Coconut 1/2 to 1 cup*Crushed jaggery 1 cup*a pinch of Salt*1/2 sp cardamom powder",
      "Method": "*Dry fry black udad dal till you get a good aroma.*Now cook it in a cooker with a pinch of salt and keep aside.*In a pan pour ghee and add cooked udad dal and jaggery.*Mix well and add coconut and cardamom powder.*Remove from the fire.*Serve hot or cold.",
      "Notes": "*This is the sundal which they distribute in Shiva Temples on Pradosham day.",
      "Images": null,
      "CreatedOn": "0001-01-01T00:00:00",
      "UpdatedOn": "0001-01-01T00:00:00"
    },
    {
