      "Method": "I will prepare this powder and keep. *Whenever want to make thuvial, I will use this powder instantly. *That is if you want to make coriander thuvial, just wash coriander, chop well and put it in a mixer grinder. *Add this powder, salt and tamarind paste. *Just grind for a min. Your thuvial is ready.*Like that you can make pudina (mint) or Curry leaves thuvial in minutes.",
