      "Title": "Tips",
      "Ingredients": "Here are some useful tips.*Shape the rice into the kids favorite figure by using the small cookie mold and decorate buttons, etc. with boiled peas carrots, etc.",
      "Method": "Most soups (without too many pieces), especially smooth like tomato, spinach, carrot are excellent.*Porridge made from the rice, wheat or bajra etc. are also very nourishing.*If the climate permits, fruit juices are also ideal, but without colouring and artificial flavoring.*If the kids prefer sweeter taste, substitute the saltiness in most recipes with sugar and vice versa.",
