      "Ingredients": "Peel Potato and Make slices.*Put it in salt / plain water.*Heat oil and fry them. *OR",
      "Method": "Peel potatoes.*Put them in water as whole.*Heat oil in a pan.*Make slices over HOT OIL directly.*(If u r afraid, slice just 1 potato. Immediately fry it. Else it will surely turn brown)*Collect fried, white, crispy chips and store it in a tin.",
