      "Ingredients": "1 cup Urad(white) daal*1 Onion sliced*1 Tomato diced*1tsp Ginger grated*1-2 Green chilies chopped*Coriander leaves finely chopped*1tsp Cumin seeds*2 bayleaves*2 cloves*1/2 tsp. turmeric powder*Salt to taste*A pinch of Garam masala*Red chili powder to taste*2tbsp oil*1tsp lemon juice",
