      "Method": "*Soak Udad dhal for 1/2 hour and grind by adding less water.*Add salt, chopped green chilies and asafetida powder.*Heat oil in a deep pan and make big vadas buy putting big holes in the center.*Turn them occasionally.*Mean while put salt and ginger green chilly paste in butter milk.*And mix it well. *And pour it in a deep vessel.*Remove the vada from fire when they become golden brown.*Put them in the curd mixture till the another set of vadas are ready to put.*Remove these ‘Thyer Vadas’ from the vessel and place them another plate.*Decorate them with ‘karaboondi’, fried cashew nuts and coriander leaves.",
