      "Method": "Boil 3 cups of milk. Keep aside 1 cup of Milk.*Mix Milk powder, Gelatin, Sugar & Corn flour in 1 cup of Milk which is kept aside.*Put that mixture in the boiling Milk.*Cool it.*Afterwards put butter and few drops of Vanilla essence and keep in freezer.*Take out after 1/2 hour and put in the mixer.*Put again in the freezer.*It will be ready to serve.",
