      "Method": "In a pan make seasoning with mustard seeds, channa dhal, thur dhal and red chilly.*Add cut onion and fry well.*Add tamarind juice*Add salt, fenugreek powder, asafetida and kari patha.*Allow it to boil for 10 min.*Add cut tomato pieces and boil for 2 more min.*Remove from the fire.*Serve with cooked rice.",
