      "Method": "In a pan make seasoning.*Add onion and tomato. Stir well.*Add cleaned keerai in that.*Add salt and allow it to cook.*Now add cooked dal and mix well.*In another pan, dry fry cumin, red chilly and rice.*Powder them and put it in the keerai.*Bring it to a boil and remove from the fire.*Serve with chappati or rice.",
