      "Notes": "This is the best kootu for chappati and as well as rice. Very good for sugar patients. When you prepare for sugar patients or weight watchers dont add coconut. Instead of that you can use coconut oil for seasoning. It will give a good smell to Kootu and you will not feel bad without coconut.",
