      "Method": "*Grind the urad dal. *If using the grinder just grind as per idli batter. *Then soak the atta in 1 cup of water. *When the urad dough is ready add the atta batter into the same. *Run the grinder for 5 minutes. *Add salt to taste.*Keep outside overnight.*The next day you can  makes dosas as you make any dosas.*The colour comes a golden and with all the holes.... the same like our dosa.*",
